<h1>Special Commands (COM Interface)</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="Description"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> These commands are not available for execution via the command line. They are passed to KUBE through the COM interface.</p>
<p>The following table lists all available special commands:</p>
<table cellspacing="0" width="798" class="whs4">
<col class="whs5">
<col class="whs6">
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td width="22.306%" class="whs8">
<p class="parameterstitle">ScanPrescan</p>
</td>
<td width="77.694%" class="whs9">
<p class="normal-table">Enters Prescan mode of KUBE (same as selecting the PreScan command from localiser driven menu).</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td width="22.306%" class="whs10">
<p class="parameterstitle">ScanPause</p>
</td>
<td width="77.694%" class="whs11">
<p class="normal-table">Enters Scan mode of KUBE (if not) in pause (same as selecting the Scan command from localiser driven menu or entering pause mode if scanning).</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td width="22.306%" class="whs10">
<p class="parameterstitle">ScanCapture</p>
</td>
<td width="77.694%" class="whs11">
<p class="normal-table">Enters Scan mode of KUBE (if not) in pause (same as start scanning if in Scan mode).</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td width="22.306%" class="whs10">
<p class="parameterstitle">ScanView</p>
</td>
<td width="77.694%" class="whs11">
<p class="normal-table">Enters View mode (same as selecting View command from localiser driven menu).</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="22.306%" class="whs10">
<p class="parameterstitle">ScanIdle</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="77.694%" class="whs11">
<p class="normal-table">Exits Prescan, Scan, or View mode.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td width="22.306%" class="whs10">
<p class="parameterstitle">PressA</p>
</td>
<td width="77.694%" class="whs11">
<p class="normal-table">Command for pressing '<span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>A</b></span>' button.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td width="22.306%" class="whs10">
<p class="parameterstitle">ReleaseA</p>
</td>
<td width="77.694%" class="whs11">
<p class="normal-table">Command for releasing '<span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>A</b></span>' button.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td width="22.306%" class="whs10">
<p class="parameterstitle">PressB</p>
</td>
<td width="77.694%" class="whs11">
<p class="normal-table">Command for pressing '<span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>B</b></span>' button.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td width="22.306%" class="whs10">
<p class="parameterstitle">ReleaseB</p>
</td>
<td width="77.694%" class="whs11">
<p class="normal-table">Command for releasing '<span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>B</b></span>' button.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="22.306%" class="whs10">
<p class="parameterstitle">GetEndEffector</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="77.694%" class="whs11">
<p class="normal-table">Returns position and orientation matrix of End Effector (Oxyz coordinate system of the sensor).</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="22.306%" class="whs10">
<p class="parameterstitle">SetProfile(<span style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;"><i>"ProfileName"</i></span>)</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="77.694%" class="whs11">
<p class="normal-table">Sets the designated profile. This command can be called even in pause mode.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="22.306%" class="whs10">
<p class="parameterstitle">GetProfile</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="77.694%" class="whs11">
<p class="normal-table">Returns current profile.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="22.306%" class="whs10">
<p class="parameterstitle">Dospherequalification()</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="77.694%" class="whs11">
<p class="normal-table">Launches the sphere alignment wizard <span><a href="Commands/Dospherequalification.htm" style="font-style:italic; color:#ff0000;"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs12" alt=""></a></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td width="22.306%" class="whs10">
<p class="parameterstitle">ScanCalculate()</p>
</td>
<td width="77.694%" class="whs11">
<p class="normal-table">Calculate alignment results at the end of sphere qualification wizard (when all data are captured)</p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="Warning">SetProfile and AutoView macro commands can be executed in <span style="text-decoration:underline;"><u>Pause</u></span> mode as well as in <span style="text-decoration:underline;"><u>Idle</u></span> mode when called via COM interface. When called from KUBE Command Window they can be only executed in <span style="text-decoration:underline;"><u>Idle</u></span> mode.</p>
<p class="Use"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Use:</b></span> Special commands are used for communication with the hardware - sensor and localiser and they can automate scanning and probe capture jobs.</p>
